<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador's monetary base slipped 0.38 pct in Feb.</title>
<headline>Ecuador's monetary base slipped 0.38 pct in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador's monetary base fell 0.38 percent to 2.84 billion sucres in February, the Central Bank said Monday.</p>
<p>In January, monetary base fell 6.8 percent to 2.85 billion sucres. It totalled 3.06 billion sucres at the end of 1996.</p>
<p>((-- Gustavo Oviedo, Quito Newsroom, 5932 258433))</p>
